{"yunastiH": [{"id": "yUnastiH", "headword": "यूनस्तिः", "headword_slp1": "yUnastiH", "fold": "yunastiH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The feminine affix ति comes after the प्रातिपदिक (Nominal Stem) युवन् and this affix gets the name तद्धित।\n\nTerms: तद्धित", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यूनस्तिः ४.१.७७", "४.१.७७", "४.१.७७ यूनस्तिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yUnastiH ४.१.७७", "४.१.७७", "४.१.७७ yUnastiH"]}], "yuni luk": [{"id": "yUni luk", "headword": "यूनि लुक्", "headword_slp1": "yUni luk", "fold": "yuni luk", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "There is लुक् elision of the युवन् गोत्र (Patronymic) forming affix -- जीवति तु वंश्ये युवा ४.१.१६३, when a प्राग्दीव्यतीय affix beginning with a vowel is to be added.\n\nTerms: लुक्-गोत्र", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यूनि लुक् ४.१.९०", "४.१.९०", "४.१.९० यूनि लुक्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yUni luk ४.१.९०", "४.१.९०", "४.१.९० yUni luk"]}], "yunasca kutsayam": [{"id": "yUnaSca kutsAyAm", "headword": "यूनश्च कुत्सायाम्", "headword_slp1": "yUnaSca kutsAyAm", "fold": "yunasca kutsayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The युवन् is optionally spoken of as गोत्र when contemptuous reference to him is intended.\n\nTerms: युवन्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यूनश्च कुत्सायाम् ४.१.१६७", "४.१.१६७", "४.१.१६७ यूनश्च कुत्सायाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yUnaSca kutsAyAm ४.१.१६७", "४.१.१६७", "४.१.१६७ yUnaSca kutsAyAm"]}]}